Changes in this fork include, among others:
  - Renamed and rebranded the project to Agentic Inbox Codebam across the
    README, app UI, MCP metadata, configuration examples, and scripts.
  - Added per-domain catch-all mailbox routing.
  - Added global and per-mailbox AI email categorization using TypeSafe Jev.
  - Added the combined All Accounts email view.
  - Added multi-select bulk actions (mark read/unread, star, archive, move,
    mark spam, delete) to the mailbox folder list and the All Accounts view.
  - Added agent-first MCP authentication using Wrangler login credentials.
  - Added Markdown support to the email composer and split heavy composer
    chunks so they are lazy-loaded.
  - Added system-preference dark mode.
  - Updated dependencies to resolve security advisories.
  - All other changes are documented in the project git history.

